sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Service as Service Métier
    participant DB as Base de Données
    participant Outbox as Table Outbox
    participant Publisher as Publisher Service
    participant Broker as Message Broker
    participant Consumer as Consumer

    Note over Client,Consumer: Flux normal avec succès
    
    Client->>Service: 1. Requête création commande
    Service->>DB: 2. BEGIN TRANSACTION
    Service->>DB: 3. INSERT INTO orders (...)
    Service->>Outbox: 4. INSERT INTO outbox (event, payload, status='PENDING')
    Service->>DB: 5. COMMIT
    
    Note over Publisher: Cycle de polling (ex: toutes les secondes)
    
    loop Lecture périodique
        Publisher->>Outbox: 6. SELECT * FROM outbox WHERE status='PENDING' AND retry_count < 3
        Outbox-->>Publisher: 7. Liste des messages non traités
        
        alt Messages trouvés
            Publisher->>Broker: 8. publish(event, payload)
            Broker-->>Publisher: 9. Ack
            
            Publisher->>Outbox: 10. UPDATE outbox SET status='PROCESSED', processed_at=NOW()
            
            Broker->>Consumer: 11. Distribution du message
            Consumer-->>Broker: 12. Ack
        end
    end